From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: milkflint <milkflint@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:07:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] milkflint compat: pre-d49721c2 action frame layout for
 OpenWrt 25.12 mac80211

Upstream d49721c2 ("wifi: move action code from per-type frame structs")
changed struct ieee80211_mgmt; Linux 6.18 headers (OpenWrt 25.12
backports) still have u.action.u.addba_req.action_code. Keep upstream's
full-length bounds check, expressed for the old layout. Not for upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 mt76_connac_mac.c | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mt76_connac_mac.c b/mt76_connac_mac.c
index 8481eac8..5fff968a 100644
--- a/mt76_connac_mac.c
+++ b/mt76_connac_mac.c
@@ -422,10 +422,10 @@ mt76_connac2_mac_write_txwi_80211(struct mt76_dev *dev, __le32 *txwi,
 	u32 val;
 
 	if (ieee80211_is_action(fc) &&
-	    skb->len >= IEEE80211_MIN_ACTION_SIZE(addba_req.capab) &&
+	    skb->len >= offsetofend(struct ieee80211_mgmt, u.action.u.addba_req.capab) &&
 	    mgmt->u.action.category == WLAN_CATEGORY_BACK &&
-	    mgmt->u.action.action_code == WLAN_ACTION_ADDBA_REQ) {
-		u16 capab = le16_to_cpu(mgmt->u.action.addba_req.capab);
+	    mgmt->u.action.u.addba_req.action_code == WLAN_ACTION_ADDBA_REQ) {
+		u16 capab = le16_to_cpu(mgmt->u.action.u.addba_req.capab);
 
 		txwi[5] |= cpu_to_le32(MT_TXD5_ADD_BA);
 		tid = (capab >> 2) & IEEE80211_QOS_CTL_TID_MASK;
